  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, peel, and mince ginger. Place in a small bowl along with stir-fry sauce, miso paste, vinegar, salt, and pepper. Stir to combine the sauce and set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat a large pot over medium-high heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the pot is hot, add oil and swirl to coat the bottom. Add riced cauliflower, edamame, mushrooms, and carrots; stir-fry until tender and warmed through, about 6 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add sauce and peanuts to the pot. Continue to cook, stirring occasionally, until sauce thickens, 2-3 minutes more. Remove from heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide cauliflower-edamame \"fried rice\" between plates or bowls. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
